WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.778
This is one page of a standing desk manual.

2
00:00:03.778 --> 00:00:05.886
Now, watch the same steps.

3
00:00:06.236 --> 00:00:09.057
Lower each leg into its crossbar end,

4
00:00:09.057 --> 00:00:13.062
motor first. Start all four screws by hand.

5
00:00:13.062 --> 00:00:14.572
Then tighten them.

6
00:00:15.222 --> 00:00:18.070
Push a side bracket into each end.

7
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:19.877
Then slide in the two center rails,

8
00:00:19.877 --> 00:00:22.071
with the slots facing inward.

9
00:00:22.721 --> 00:00:25.882
Set the frame on the desktop, and center it.

10
00:00:25.882 --> 00:00:28.613
Start every screw before you tighten any of them.

11
00:00:29.263 --> 00:00:32.255
Fit the control box and the keypad.

12
00:00:32.255 --> 00:00:35.556
Push in both leg cables, the keypad cable,

13
00:00:35.556 --> 00:00:38.120
and the power cable, until they click.

14
00:00:38.769 --> 00:00:42.725
Put a foot on each leg, with the long end toward the front.

15
00:00:42.725 --> 00:00:45.412
Start four screws in each, then tighten.

16
00:00:46.063 --> 00:00:49.778
With two people, turn the desk onto its back edge.

17
00:00:49.778 --> 00:00:52.066
Then, set it down on its feet.

18
00:00:53.463 --> 00:00:58.530
Plug it in. Hold the down button until the display shows reset.

19
00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.758
Let go, then hold it again, until the desk dips,

20
00:01:01.758 --> 00:01:03.327
and rises.

21
00:01:04.027 --> 00:01:07.431
That is the whole page, and nobody had to guess.
